      "title": "Lecturer Pool",
      "description": "Lecturer Pool - Department of Environmental Science, Policy, and Management - Rausser College of Natural Resources (JPF05548) - UC Berkeley AP Recruit Skip to main content Recruit Home Open Recruitments Lecturer Pool - Department of Environmental Science, Policy, and Management - Rausser College of Natural Resources (JPF05548) Lecturer Pool - Department of Environmental Science, Policy, and Management - Rausser College of Natural Resources Apply now to Lecturer Pool - Department of Environmental Science, Policy, and Management - Rausser College of Natural Resources Job #JPF05548 Environ Sci, Policy & Mgmt / College of Natural Resources / UC Berkeley Position overview Salary range: The UC academic salary scales set the minimum pay at appointment. See the current Unit 18 Pre-Six Lecturer Salary Scale .  The current full-time salary range for this position is $73,817–$207,711. Percent time: Appointments are typically part-time. Anticipated start: Positions usually start in January, various times throughout the summer and August. Review timeline: Applications will be accepted and reviewed for any department needs through September 23, 2027. Applicants are considered for positions as needs arise; the existence of this applicant pool does not guarantee that a position is available. Applications are typically reviewed for fall course needs in April/May, spring course needs in October/November, and summer session course needs in January/February. Position duration: Varied and may be renewable based on need, funding, and performance. Application Window Open date: September 23, 2026 Next review date: Wednesday, Oct 7, 2026 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Apply by this date to ensure full consideration by the committee. Final date: Thursday, Sep 23, 2027 at 11:59pm (Pacific Time) Applications will continue to be accepted until this date, but those received after the review date will only be considered if the position has not yet been filled. Position descriptio